{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:45 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"中年好聲音4丨尹景順領軍10強伊館開騷 互相扶持施展渾身解數畫完美句號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0158def7cb4cbc83ee8d02114eafa3ee/2026-10/cats1_48.jpg\"/>\n<p>昨晚《中年好聲音4越唱越強演唱會》首場演出在伊利沙伯體育館圓滿完成，十強歌手包括尹景順、許雲妮、鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、吳亦偉、尤淑情、許美琪、周志康、 陳旭培、鄭仲豪在台上施展渾身解數，為大家帶來視覺聽覺都非常豐富的一個晚上。在分享環節時，10位歌手不約而同感謝中年好聲音這個比賽，令他們有機會踏上舞台唱歌給大家聽，也很感恩得到大家的友誼。</p>\n<img alt=\"尹景順落力演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/763858d4bb2958897b1610546b8f875d/2026-10/2__4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"尹景順、鄭家聲鬥唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b18bbb0fae587d3fc6e5010a521fcaf/2026-10/179207032278206.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"尹景順全情投入。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5a31471c8c6ae66378c5b2804753bf6e/2026-10/179207032242683.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳亦偉(左)、陳旭培(右)合唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8275c70db2e3c29c89b589da51d8910a/2026-10/179207032237381.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"周志康(左起)、鄭仲豪、陳旭培展示歌藝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/995341e2f61719032d5d19ec1f8e8ddb/2026-10/___5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許美琪(左起)、尤淑情、蔡宓婕、許雲妮享受舞台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/21789788d42bbee09bcb8837197f2862/2026-10/___0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳旭培(左起)、吳亦偉、尹景順互相扶持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e0b03b9150c865fb91086efce34d36c7/2026-10/___1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳亦偉\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a6a1a2aa1f93527c735053be0e7e0e01/2026-10/179207032244238.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許美琪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9d2074f6465e8216ec3ebee3bcbc4b31/2026-10/2__0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許美琪及蔡宓婕有默契。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/64cd9f236261a67c89ce4efc99269e17/2026-10/179207032284626.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"許雲妮 穿性感舞戰衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6f959f272cf356ba4418ebe659a42b7e/2026-10/179207032287943.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳旭培\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75092e805476883ce00cb54c97310dd0/2026-10/2__1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡宓婕被抬起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7476447bad045958bfebe27da3bc41c0/2026-10/179207032246196.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭仲豪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9bcdee400884c0a300b24029ae38d905/2026-10/179207032224066.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄭家聲載歌載舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2807166f2f8ce657a45623284712b365/2026-10/3__0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/78f4d400428f0c5a92d297ea5c4a53a5/2026-10/179207032241559.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"尤淑情收復失地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/92e4bb54df1027dd3bccd26fa9ed3b15/2026-10/179207037148292.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"昨晚《中年好聲音4越唱越強演唱會》首場演出在伊利沙伯體育館圓滿完成。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/12ccfcf056ce1ee5ae0fdaab5087b3e1/2026-10/165A5052.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"十強在台上施展渾身解數。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b00a07e8ab5368f204e02aee35bb7da9/2026-10/165A4885.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以周華健金曲《朋友》畫完美句號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a3a8188fb2b3690c28c1bddf9cc8c512/2026-10/165A4617.jpg\"/>\n<h2>周華健金曲《朋友》作結</h2>\n<p>在過去一年大家互相鼓勵互相扶持、希望在日後的任何演出也可以聽到大家的掌聲。最後他們以周華健的《朋友》為全晚演唱會畫上完美句號，也期待今晚（15 日)在伊館舞台上繼續為大家帶來精彩的演出，創造屬於彼此的回憶。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:59:26.862425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":21,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:45:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:18:26.587055+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T14:57:46.506216+00:00","content_hash":"ff753eaeb7cc54b26efb11275d883dfd45c42040d8fcd5f77299ae70bfca536a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}